<ul>
  <li>The service is a test beta: errors, interruptions or data loss are possible, with no commitment to availability. Keep a copy of your important certificates ("<%= t('cert.print') %>" button).</li>
  <li>You do not send any real client data or files: test data only.</li>
  <li>Beta accounts and data may be deleted or reset at any time.</li>
  <li>A feedback link ("<%= t('feedback.link') %>") and a contact address let you report a bug or suggest an idea; a Discord server serves as the beta community.</li>
  <li>The beta is free. Pricing will be communicated before any switch to a paid service.</li>
  <li>Person responsible for the beta: <%- legal('betaResponsible') %>.</li>
</ul>
